  unitName: Head Thief Leon
  unitId: 10062
  unitNumber: 80
  description: With a simple credo of "help the weak, crush the strong", he came
    to lead a large band of thieves around the ruined Agni Empire. Trading his knives
    for swords as the war with the gods began, he fought for the masses. Alas, the
    officials he hurt before interfered, leaving him with enemies among the gods
    and the empire, but he was still able to meet a heroic end.
  summonDesc: I know you know who I am,<br>and you know I'm expecting <br>a reward.
  fusionDesc: That's an interesting reward.<br>OK! I'll fight for you more!
  evoDesc: Hehe, you can count on me!<br>I will save those who cannot<br>save themselves!
  element: 1
  rarity: 2
